  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7ff7e1a551b864e4d94b235e1b05b001, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story_introduct_09
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "Ng\xE0y th\xE1ng tr\xF4i \u0111i nhanh nh\u01B0 b\xF3ng n\u1EAFng tr\xEAn
      b\xE3i c\xE1t. Tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i c\u1EDD lau n\u0103m n\xE0o \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA1i trong ta ni\u1EC1m say m\xEA k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1 \u2013 c\xE1i c\u1EA3m
      gi\xE1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u1EABn d\u1EAFt, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EE9ng
      m\u0169i ch\u1ECBu s\xE0o. Nh\u01B0ng cu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1EDDi kh\xF4ng m\xE3i
      l\xE0 tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i."
    - "Hoa L\u01B0 \u2013 v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t n\xFAi k\u1EC1 s\xF4ng, m\u01B0a
      n\u1EAFng th\u1EA5t th\u01B0\u1EDDng, l\xFAc hi\u1EC1n h\xF2a, l\xFAc d\u1EEF
      d\u1ED9i. Ta l\u1EDBn l\xEAn c\xF9ng m\xF9a g\u1EB7t, c\xF9ng ti\u1EBFng tr\u1ED1ng
      h\u1ED9i, v\xE0 c\u1EA3 nh\u1EEFng \u0111\xEAm gi\xF4ng b\xE3o d\u1ECDa nu\u1ED1t
      ch\u1EEDng c\u1EA3 l\xE0ng."
    - "Ta kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh m\u1EC7nh \u0111ang ch\u1EDD ta \u0111i\u1EC1u
      g\xEC, nh\u01B0ng ta bi\u1EBFt: \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EF1ng nghi\u1EC7p l\u1EDBn,
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt ph\u1EA3i h\u1ECDc c\xE1ch \u0111\u1ED1i di\u1EC7n
      v\u1EDBi s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a thi\xEAn nhi\xEAn \u2013 th\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng
      ai c\xF3 th\u1EC3 xem th\u01B0\u1EDDng."
